Comparator checks that the theorems proved in Solution.lean are exactly the
statements in Challenge.lean, using only the three standard axioms, and the proofs are replayed
by Lean's kernel and by independent kernels.

The text quoted in docs/OQP_STATEMENT.md is from Problem 43 of the IQOQI Vienna Open Quantum
Problems list (https://oqp.iqoqi.oeaw.ac.at/are-all-extensibly-causal-processes-purifiable);
it is quoted with attribution and is not covered by the licence of this repository.

This repository depends on Mathlib (Apache License 2.0), which is not included in it.

